<title>USA: Maine Health/Higher Ed. repriced, top yield raised.</title>
<headline>Maine Health/Higher Ed. repriced, top yield raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons, Inc. said Tuesday it repriced Maine Health &amp; Higher Educational Facilities Authority's bond deal, raising the top yield five basis points to 5.70 percent in 2027.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
